#. translators: %d: months the data is kept
#: inc/admin_page.php:393
#, php-format
msgid "These statistics use no cookies and store no IP addresses. A visitor is recognised only within one day, by an anonymous code that changes every night, so for a period of several days \"Visitors\" is the sum of each day's unique visitors. Data is kept for %d month. Logged-in users are not counted."
msgid_plural "These statistics use no cookies and store no IP addresses. A visitor is recognised only within one day, by an anonymous code that changes every night, so for a period of several days \"Visitors\" is the sum of each day's unique visitors. Data is kept for %d months. Logged-in users are not counted."
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""

#: inc/admin_page.php:421
msgid "The web server passes the address of a proxy to WordPress instead of the visitor's (REMOTE_ADDR is an internal address and the request has X-Forwarded-For). All visitors would be counted as one. Configure the server to pass the real client IP (for example mod_remoteip or the nginx real_ip module)."
msgstr ""

